  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwit pipö Israel löwïr surkwen pö Sin arawa tagh akïmang Kades, kïröpösyï Miriam Kades, akerorchï wölini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimöminye nyu pögh cho pö pich, kighamït kegh pich akwompö paraku Musa nko Aron ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïngwïrngwïronchö lö, “Kitö ngwangwa kemeghenöcha nko werköcha ompö tawu ECHOTYON ompö Ema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö ne tamïtunakwa söpïchï pö ECHOTYON surkwenï? Atökemeghyenö nko kyakicho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö ne tamïtunenechakwa Misri kepkana koronï gha le nyï mömi kïgh nyo rïro? Möminye pagh nko makany nko sapipun nko makumanka* amöminye ompö pögh tïkwïte cho kïgheghöy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngeta nyu Musa nko Aron söpïch pö Israel akutang kuka Ema nyo mi ECHOTYON* akïkïtïng. Kungwïnchï chane ororyo ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chenga lïkïyay ompö tawu ECHOTYON aituyö pïchï löwïr, nyi nko Aron aingölonchï ghatyaninö ompö tawungwa ato kipkana pögh ghatyanini cho gheghöy pïchï nko kyakikwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Musa kïcheng lïkïyay ompö tawu ECHOTYON lenyini kömwochï ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kighomityï Musa nko Aron pipö Israel tawu ghatyanay akïlenchï chane, “Atere kon penyichï, kimukecha so kekonokwa pögh ompö ghatyanï?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïsyol Musa ewunyi akulïwö lïkïyay ghatyanay kïnyïl odeny, kïpka pögh cho kigha pïchay nko kyakikwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa nko Aron, “Ompöwölo melö kaghananïkwa aparta ororyenyan ompö tawu pipö Israel, momïtekwanye nyu pïchï ntökwit kor nyo kyoyomisön lö otönan chane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kighisyö choni ompö pögho Meripa, wölay kingwïrngwïronchineghö pipö Israel ECHOTYON, akuporchï ECHOTYON chane tïlilyenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Katagh pöytoghinto Edom kuwer pipö Israel korenyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyonta Musa pich ompö Kades kïpa wölo mi pöytoghinto Edom, akïlenchï, “Chï kï werkökwa pipö Israel. Inkïtönyi kömpölelut cho kikïnyorucha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ainkïtönyi wölo kipetïta papotïnecha Misri akemangacha Misri nyo kogh, kuchopecha kong pipö Misri nko papotïnecha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akï otini kikïlokyicha ECHOTYON, kïlïm lokecha akuyokï malaykayan nyo kimïtunenecha koro Misri, kïmicha ye nyu Kades kanasyan nyo mi rotyengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsomecha ye nyu lö pïswecha kewera korengu, acha nko kyakicha, amökiwerechanye paren anta pareni sapipun amökïgheghechanye pögheku, kiwerecha or akonga melö kïmostocha okumpö tagh anta akumpö löt ntöketïlacha korengu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Edom, “Mochömwokwanye awera korencha. Kwato amwaghakwa lö kiweröy, ongwïnan oporyeghenokwa nyo mötïny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pipö Israel nyinte, “Kiwerecha or akonga onkït, kïnyïl ato kïgheghacha nko kyakicho pögheku, keghokucha, wölo nya keweracha kwïle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Edom, “Memukonye awerakwa, kïpka lenyini pipö lïk kïporyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenyona kïwöghökisyö pipö Israel akïpa ore anka ompöwölo kitagh Edom kuwer chane korenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Megha Aron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpegha pipö Israel Kades ntökwit kutïng pö Or rotyo Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa nko Aron ompö kutïng pö Or rotyo Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Metönye Aron kor nyo kyoyomisön lö otönan pipö Israel, meghöy nyinte ompöwölo kyapenyakwa ngölyontenyan ompö pögho Meripa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mïta Aron nko werïnyi Eleasar kutang kutïng pö Or, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aingwïs sïro pö Aron cho pö tïsintön ailokyï Eleasar, ompöwölo meghchini Aron wöloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh Musa lenyini kimwa ECHOTYON, kïpa kutïng pö Or kïsïwïyi pipö Israel löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 29:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 33:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 10:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngwïs Musa sïro pö Aron cho pö tïsintön akulokyï Eleasar, kïmeghchï Aron kutïng parak, kïrökï nyu Musa nko Eleasar ompö kutïngay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
